Johnny Castaway recomp

The project layout is from the Space Bucks recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/spacebucks-recomp). The Win16 front end, the
host runtime and the screen saver host are pcrecomp's
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp), MIT.

work/win16_imports.json (generated, not shipped) holds Win16 API names by
ordinal, built from Wine's 16-bit .spec files by pcrecomp's
tools/ne/wine_spec_to_json.py. No Wine code is used.

tools/kd_expand.py decodes the PKWARE Data Compression Library format. It is
written for this project in Python; the shape of its decoder (canonical codes
built from the format's fixed bit-length tables) follows Mark Adler's blast.c,
which ships with zlib under the zlib licence (https://zlib.net/zlib_license.html).

